    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38638" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prōflŭvĭus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Flowing;</i> trop., <i>fluctuating</i>, <i>inconstant</i>: profluvia fides,
			Caecil. ap. <i><span class="en">Prisc. p. 699</span></i>
			P.—</div>
